---
permalink: /404.html
lang: de
routeKey: home
noindex: true
sitemap: false
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: "Seite nicht gefunden — DIWEBA"
description: "Diese Seite existiert nicht oder wurde verschoben."
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#
  Bilingual 404.

  Cloudflare serves this for unmatched routes with a genuine 404 status — the
  Worker sets the status code; serving it as 200 would let Google index an error
  page (spec §10).

  Both languages appear because the failed URL may be in either, and a German-only
  error page is unhelpful to an English visitor who mistyped a /en/ path.

  routeKey is `home` purely so the layout's canonical/hreflang machinery has a
  valid entry to resolve; the page itself is noindex and excluded from the
  sitemap, so neither is used for indexing.
#}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="stack stack--lg">

      <div class="stack">
        <h1>{{ ui.de.error404.title }}</h1>
        <p class="text-soft">{{ ui.de.error404.body }}</p>
        <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ routes.home.de }}">{{ ui.de.error404.back }}</a></p>
      </div>

      <hr>

      <div class="stack" lang="en">
        <h2>{{ ui.en.error404.title }}</h2>
        <p class="text-soft">{{ ui.en.error404.body }}</p>
        <p><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ routes.home.en }}">{{ ui.en.error404.back }}</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
